          "filename": "1960 Studebaker Lark Deluxe Convertible (8451761887).jpg",
          "caption": "The compact Lark was introduced in 1959 and available in Deluxe or Regal. Engines; VI; 170 6 cyl or VIII; 259 V8. \nIn 1961 the LWB Cruiser was introduced with the 289 V8 option, Cruisers and Regals got 4 headlights. \nIn 1962 all 4 doors had LWB and the top trim was the Daytona. \nIn 1963 the Deluxe became the Standard and the supercharged  'Superlark' was available. \n\nNew shape in 64; trim levels; Callenger, Commander and Cruiser (Daytona on Hardtops)",
